2 CONT Kari Pedersdatter Found 10 Records, 6 Photos and 260,404 Family Trees  Born in Gjose Garden, Vinger, Norway on 1591 to Peder. Kari married Hans Gudmundsen and had 13 children. She passed away on 1674 in Ovre, Gjermhus, Vinger, Nor
