2 CONT * Daughter of Jon Ivarsson Broka
2 CONT * It must be Holmfrid who, on 25 July 1478, is described as Pytting's widow at Storda (Stola), where, with her son Pytting's consent, she gives a meadow in Aspås to Otterstadha monastery. The Pytting family is a "salvation family"
2 CONC  and we meet several representatives of the family in the Swedish Diplomatarium. Those called by the family name Pytting (Byting) all carry a beam in their weapon. Source: Sogneprest B.O. Stuve.
2 CONT
