2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Fartegn Matsson was descended from the lågadel branch of the Losna family and he lived his entire life in Kvinnherad. He was living at Seim in 1519, which belonged to the Rustung family. Fartegn married Karen Koll, the widow of Tr
2 CONC ond Rustung, and became the step-father of Kristoffer Trondsson Rustung. Around 1530, he probably moved to Ænes in Kvinnherad, which he rented from Archbishop Olav Engelbriktsson. He was living there in 1563, but was dead by 1564.
2 CONC  Fartegn and his brothers were named in a series of court cases concerning inheritances between 1525 and 1532. Fartegn, himself, may have been considered a member of the lower nobility as several documents describe him as "av våpe
2 CONC n". 
