1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Anne Jacobsd Nordfjell was a widow when she married the parish clerk and widower Frans Olsen Langeland in 1743. Her first husband was Ole Eriksen Nordre Pramhus (1701-1742), they married 1735 and they got two child
