2 CONC mund Johannessen Huvneshøgda i Vinger, Kari https://www.geni.com/people/Kari-Sch%C3%B8yen/6000000019029316531 f 1796, Anne f 1799, Marte f 1802, Eli f 1805, g 1832 m Ola Knutsen Branerud, Lars f 1808, Hans 1811-86, g 1850 m Olea O
2 CONC lsd. Nyhus. En sønn tok over:'''
