2 CONC .geni.com/people/Christian-Olsen/6000000012470308950 f 1874, Maria Olava https://www.geni.com/people/Marie-Olsdatter/6000000052158266852 f 1876, til Oslo, Anton Olsen https://www.geni.com/people/Anton-Olsen/6000000100100640086 187
2 CONC 8-1933, tok over, Ole f 1880, Marius f 1883, Engebret https://www.geni.com/people/Engebret-Olsen/6000000008364988921 f ca. 1885, til Amerika, Anna https://www.geni.com/people/Anna-Olesdatter/6000000032836635995 f ca. 1885, g m Eri
