1 DEAT
2 DATE 1723
2 PLAC Forkerud
2 ADDR
3 STAE Hedmark
3 CTRY Norge
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} There are several different opinions on Erik's patronym: Amundsen or Syversen or Ellevsen
2 CONT
2 CONT Erik Forkerud's patronym is listed as '''Amundsen''', in the Grue Bygdebok. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Priscilla Sorknes wrote "''My strong feelings is that the Erik who owned Forkerud (probably before 1700) was not Erik Amundsen.  A person of that patronymic owned Forkerud in Vinger/Eidskog.  The Forkerud Erik has a likely relativ
2 CONC e with the patronymic '''Ellevsen''' and there is a Ellevsen name connection to the Strømsnes farm in Brandval at that time.  So he is my choice, but I have no proof to date''."
2 CONT
2 CONT A FamilySearch.com entry lists Pernille Eriksdtr Forkerud and Tosten Eriksen Forkerud's father as Erik '''Syversen''' Forkerud.
2 CONT
2 CONT "''Erik Syversen Forkerud (son of Syver Forkerud) was born Abt. 1676 in Grue, Hedmark, Norway, and died date unknown.'' "
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/f/l/a/Brad-Flatten/WEBSITE-0001/UHP-0399.html
