2 CONT <p>Fra eidskogslekt.no:</p><p>Arne Amundsen d.y. Langfoss was born about 1685. He died in 1745. He lived in Nordstun, Langfoss, Eidskog, Vinger, Hedmark. He is reference number 4941. Parents: Amund Olsen Langfoss and Anne Arnesdat
2 CONC ter.</p>Spouse: Åse Olsdatter Kisen. Arne Amundsen d.y. Langfoss and Åse Olsdatter Kisen were married on 7 Oct 1706. Children were: Anne Arnesdatter Langfoss, Ole Arnesen Langfoss, Kari Arnesdatter Langfoss, Amund Arnesen Langfoss
2 CONC , Eli Arnesdatter Langfoss.
