1 NAME Ole Hermansen /Magnor/
2 GIVN Ole Hermansen
2 _MARNM Magnor
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1677
2 ADDR
3 STAE Hedmark
3 CTRY Norway
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1739
2 PLAC Magnor Vestgarn
